# Frontend uses relative API calls (/api) proxied in development (Vite) and production (nginx)
# No VITE_API_URL configuration needed - the proxy handles routing automatically
# 
# This file is provided for reference only - frontend configuration is minimal by design
# Backend URL is handled via:
# - Development: Vite proxy in vite.config.ts (reads BACKEND_PORT from process.env)
# - Production: nginx template forwards /api to backend service
